<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Grand Banks - (built 1980) 57,708 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Bimini - (built 1980) 57,708 dwt sold to Greek buyers for over $18 million enbloc with subjects remaining.</p>
<p>CONTAINERS - Nedlloyd Maas - (built 1988) 13,800 dwt plus sistership:</p>
<p>Nedlloyd Musi 14,170 dwt and Nedlloyd Marne 14,101 dwt sold to Polish buyers for $13.5 million each.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection,  survey or other conditions.</p>
</text>
